<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug coal output up 8.03 percent yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug coal output up 8.03 percent yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's coal output totalled 898.7 million tonnes in the first eight months of 1996, up 8.03 percent compared with the same period last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Monday.</p>
<p>Coal production in August alone was 110.723 million tonnes, the bureau said.</p>
</text>
